# The referents named in representing-models.md §5, one per worked model.
# pmid<TAB>neurostore_id<TAB>axis
#
# Extract these with `--examples review/referents`, never the default. `review/examples`
# is the curated fixture corpus test_review_foundation.py asserts over, and it picks its
# paper as the first record there alphabetically -- so a record dropped in that both
# sorts early and carries validator errors silently becomes the fixture and fails four
# tests that have nothing to do with it.
#
# Mixed renders. Most are pubget -- review/sync_texts.py then review/build_text.py.
# 4CA3Ca2bzfPW, 3agtZxaWUcQV, 39HoutR6iLMj and 6WJs2gBAhcQL are ace-only and need
# review/sync_texts_ace.py, which states what that costs.

